// runtime). Exposed as CSS variables that globals.css maps onto Tailwind's
// --font-sans / --font-mono, so every page + the dashboard share one typeface
// instead of the browser default. Geist Sans + Geist Mono — one matched family
// for both UI text and data/code, replacing the previous Plus Jakarta Sans /
